{"about_the_game":"A panda parent in a colorful adventure. Become Penny Panda!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour babies are going through a rebellious phase and like to hide from their parents. They are too young to realize the dangers of the forest. As a parent it is your task to get them home before they get hurt (and before dinner!).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect food, avoid alligators and navigate through obstacles to complete the objectives of each mission. Find your young, have them follow you and bring them home to the den to keep them safe. You can play alone or with a co-parent to work together to complete the objectives!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2011960?t=1738970155","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2011960?t=1738970155","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738970155","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011960/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738970155","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2937080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"A panda parent in a colorful adventure. Become Penny Panda!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour babies are going through a rebellious phase and like to hide from their parents. They are too young to realize the dangers of the forest. As a parent it is your task to get them home before they get hurt (and before dinner!).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollect food, avoid alligators and navigate through obstacles to complete the objectives of each mission. Find your young, have them follow you and bring them home to the den to keep them safe. You can play alone or with a co-parent to work together to complete the objectives!","developers":